cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use or refer to this project, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: Push-Based Postgres CDC Into Delta Lake Without Kafka
authors:
  - family-names: Shinde
    given-names: Santosh
    alias: santoshshinde2012
    website: https://www.santoshshinde.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/santoshshinde2012/cdc-poc"
url: "https://github.com/santoshshinde2012/cdc-poc"
abstract: >-
  A local proof of concept that pushes Postgres changes into Delta Lake
  tables with Debezium Server and no Kafka broker. It covers logical
  replication, an idempotent Bronze change feed, and an LSN-ordered Silver
  current-state table, with end-to-end tests for lost acks, crashes, late
  events and schema changes.
keywords:
  - change-data-capture
  - postgresql
  - debezium
  - delta-lake
  - lakehouse
  - data-engineering
  - logical-replication
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-27"
